  "_comment": [
    "It Was DNS — 2,400,000 alerts and their journey to a root cause.",
    "",
    "The stress case. Strongly convergent: wide at the severity end, collapsing",
    "onto five root causes and four resolutions, so the last columns hold a few",
    "enormous nodes each carrying a dozen or more incoming ribbons. That is what",
    "makes this the hardest exercise of link stacking, which orders a node's",
    "ribbons by the vertical centre of the band at the far end — a quantity that",
    "only becomes interesting when many ribbons share one node.",
    "",
    "What the shape exercises:",
    "  - convergence rather than fan-out, so link stacking sorts long lists;",
    "  - six orders of magnitude, from 1,510,000 down to a single cosmic-ray",
    "    alert, which puts a large fraction of nodes under the drop threshold and",
    "    forces the collision pass to work in the crowded middle;",
    "  - sub-pixel ribbon heights, which the geometry stage must carry as floats",
    "    rather than rounding away.",
    "",
    "Flows are alerts and conserve to 2,400,000 exactly.",
    "",
    "Regenerate the derived files with: node tools/generate_golden.mjs"
  ],
